# easyCMDB Front-End Project Patterns

> easyCMDB is the front-end SPA for a configuration management inventory POC.
> It is a single React 19 + TypeScript app (Vite, Tailwind, shadcn/ui) served
> from CloudFront/S3. This document describes how the code is organized today.

## Project Overview

- **Single application**: one app under `src/`. No multi-application aliasing.
- **Two top-level concerns**:
  - **Discover** — read-only listing and detail views (`pages/discover/*`)
  - **Management** — administrative CRUD screens (`pages/manage/*`)
- **Domain model**: Applications, Landscapes, LandscapeEnvironments, Resources
  (defined in `src/types/cmdb.ts`).
- **POC deploy** supports multi-environment deploy (`sb`, `dev`, `tst`, `prod`)
  wired through GitHub Actions.

## Framework & Tools

### Core Framework

- **React 19** — function components and hooks only. No class components.
- **TypeScript** — strict mode (`strict: true`, `noUnusedLocals: true`,
  `noUnusedParameters: true`).
- **Vite 6** — `@vitejs/plugin-react` + `@tailwindcss/vite`; `@/` → `src/`;
  dev proxy `/api` → backend.
- **Tailwind CSS v4** — design tokens in `src/index.css` (teal/slate palette).
- **shadcn/ui (Radix)** — copy-in primitives under `components/ui/`.
- **React Router v7** — `createBrowserRouter` from `react-router` (not
  `react-router-dom`).
- **TanStack Query** — server state (lists, detail fetches, cache invalidation).
- **Zustand** — auth/session state only (`src/stores/auth.ts`).
- **Axios** — HTTP client (`src/api/http.ts`).
- **sonner** — toasts; **AlertDialog** — confirm/deactivate flows.

### Build & Dev Tools

- **tsc** — type checking via `npm run type-check`
  (`tsc -p tsconfig.app.json --noEmit`).
- **ESLint flat config** + **Prettier** — `npm run lint`, `npm run format`.
- **Vitest** + **happy-dom** — unit testing.
- **Husky** — `pre-push` runs `test:unit:ci`, `lint`, and `type-check`.

